introduction of Bluetooth wireless connectivity, today's mobile phone =
is becoming the hub for personal area networks and its user =
applications are almost limitless.  Today's mobile phone is used to =
conveniently and easily conduct worldwide, person-to-person =
communications, capture digital pictures, and even communicate to other =
devices such as PDAs, printers, personal computers, headsets and audio =
sets.<a =
href=3D"http://www.widcomm.com/NewsEvents/eNews/Q12003/BTEmobile.html">[=
