time-to-market, expedite MMI integration, and provide fast-track =
Bluetooth qualification.  Specific details will be further announced at =
the upcoming Bluetooth World Conference in Amsterdam.				<br><br><div =
align=3D"right"><a href=3D"#top">back to top</a></div><br>				<span =
