across the spectrum of microelectronics applications, and WIDCOMM are =
working together to develop complete HID (Human Interface Devices) =
Bluetooth solutions. The co-operation focuses on ready-to-manufacture =
reference designs for keyboards, mice, and other peripheral devices. =
These reference designs reduce the OEM time to market and eliminate the =
learning curve required to incorporate Bluetooth technology into =
products. The reference designs are highly customizable to accommodate =
customer's requirements and marketing need for differentiation. The =
