Cambridge, Mass.�June 17, 2003�InterSystems Corporation today announced
that TRADEPAQ Corporation, a provider of collaborative supply chain
execution solutions for global commerce, has selected its CACH�
post-relational database as the foundation technology for its TRM
trading and risk management software. The world�s fastest growing
