CACH� database.

TRADEPAQ:TRM is a specialized ERP and supply chain system that enables
enterprises to manage virtually every trading function�from the original
physical contract, through shipment of the material, to final invoicing
and payment. Interrelated modules cover contract management, risk
management, logistics, treasury and integrated accounting.

Real-Time Mark-to-Market Information

When evaluating database technologies that could provide the
reliability, performance, scalability and rapid application development
capabilities required for the ever changing commodities market, TRADEPAQ
found that CACH� was the logical choice, according to Warren Fisher,
TRADEPAQ�s executive vice president and chief operating officer. �We
