mark-to-market information provides the trader and the chief financial
officer the ability to immediately react to changing market conditions.
Optimized for Web development, the CACH� architecture is ideally suited
to support TRADEPAQ:TRM, which provides true, on-demand information,
ensuring that traders and key financial and executive staff have access
to the latest financial information needed to reduce inherent business
risk factors.

